WEBVTT

00:10:26.455 --> 00:10:30.584
by saying, “these are also
underdeveloped and underutilized.”

00:10:31.126 --> 00:10:34.672
In fact, our forests, for example,

00:10:34.713 --> 00:10:37.508
are the most sophisticated,

00:10:37.508 --> 00:10:40.886
efficient and effective
carbon storage facility in the world,

00:10:40.928 --> 00:10:44.515
in which no amount of science
and technology can beat.

00:10:45.474 --> 00:10:50.229
And our ... cultural traditions
are so sophisticated,

00:10:50.229 --> 00:10:54.316
we've been able to use these
to protect our forests

00:10:54.316 --> 00:10:55.984
and our resources.

00:10:56.735 --> 00:11:01.198
In fact, it's rampant consumerism,
greed, imperialism,